Package: PhysioCompliance
Type: Package
Title: Evidence, Privacy, and Lifecycle Controls for Physiological Records
Version: 0.4.0
Authors@R: person("Yusuke", "Matsui", email = "mail.to.matsui@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Provides deterministic, tamper-evident audit trails, externally
    authenticated electronic signatures, explicit de-identification policies,
    project-owned lifecycle and risk-document templates, normalized
    requirement-risk-control-test traceability, objective-evidence
    verification, and read-only ecosystem engineering-readiness checks for
    PhysioExperiment records and packages. Reports expose structural, linkage,
    record-state, signature, privacy, traceability, and package-readiness
    findings without repairing stored evidence. These technical controls and
    documentation aids do not determine device status, assign risk
    acceptability, authorize release, or establish conformity with a
    regulatory framework or standard.
Depends:
    R (>= 4.2.0)
Imports:
    digest,
    jsonlite,
    methods,
    openssl,
    PhysioCore,
    S4Vectors,
    SummarizedExperiment
Suggests:
